estores all eight levels and pans, preserving mute, Solo, FX, routes and audio history. Compact windows retain four readable strips.\nFX bypass uses the existing chain; direct FX editing arrives with slice 3f. Backing/click strips and foot performance use their later shared owners. No invented CPU telemetry or touch lock; these retain their separate implementation work. Recording indication remains beside Library. Bars show — until a tempo grid counts them.","lineHeight":1.4,"fontFamily":"Arimo","fontSize":28,"fontWeight":"normal"}]},{"type":"frame","id":"rmWqV","x":6700,"y":51372,"name":"26  MIDI controls and Learn","context":"Proposal. Simulated USB and DIN sources, Learn, multi-target ranges, button states, conflicts and disconnects.","width":6320,"height":4076,"fill":"#171c25","cornerRadius":24,"stroke":"#353f51","strokeWidth":2,"layout":"none","children":[{"type":"text","id":"X3GIS","x":120,"y":62,"name":"MIDI controls / Title","fill":"#d5ddf5","content":"26  MIDI controls · Learn","fontFamily":"Arimo","fontSize":68,"fontWeight":"700"},{"type":"text","id":"s91q5n","x":120,"y":160,"name":"MIDI controls / Status","fill":"#a3adbd","content":"Reviewed direction · controller → message → controls","fontFamily":"Arimo","fontSize":36,"fontWeight":"normal"},{"type":"frame","id":"RIrL3","x":120,"y":260,"name":"Controller mappings / Tile","width":1920,"height":1152,"layout":"none","children":[{"type":"text","id":"C1vOy","x":0,"y":0,"name":"Controller mappings / Label","fill":"#a3adbd","content":"Controller mappings","fontFamily":"Arimo","fontSize":34,"fontWeight":"normal"},{"type":"frame","id":"vxmoz","x":0,"y":72,"name":"MIDI / Controller mappings","context":"section","clip":true,"width":1920,"height":1080,"fill":"#111215","layout":"none","children":[{"type":"frame","id":"qoLuU","x":0,"y":0,"name":"topbar","context":"header","metadata":{"type":"prototype-element","tag":"header","rect":{"x":0,"y":0,"width":1920,"height":96},"textAlign":"start"},"width":1920,"height":96,"s